{"code":0,"message":"success","value":{"docId":"75577164cb5049ac8918330019759f82","title":"请求用户授权","lang":"cn","domain":"10100000","businessName":"HMS Core > Smart Devices","businessType":"10101014","businessTypeName":"穿戴能力","serviceType":"5734b590f11f4e839a20a8642c1a1a29","version":"V17","anchorList":[{"anchorId":"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111070__section2689154763012","level":"1","title":"查询用户授权结果","showBeta":0,"apiAtomic":0,"deviceVersion":""},{"anchorId":"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111070__section7157142771512","level":"1","title":"申请用户穿戴设备权限","showBeta":0,"apiAtomic":0,"deviceVersion":""}],"status":"4","content":{"content":"<html><head></head><body><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111070\"></a><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111070\"></a>   <h1>请求用户授权</h1>   <div>    <p>为保护用户隐私，Wear Engine的API需要用户授权才可以正常访问。建议开发者在用户首次调用Wear Engine开放能力的时候执行本章节操作。</p>    <div class=\"section\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111070__section2689154763012\">     <a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111070__section2689154763012\"></a><a name=\"section2689154763012\"></a>     <h4>查询用户授权结果</h4>     <p>用于查询用户是否授予第三方应用权限。如果检测到用户未授权，请参见下一节<a href=\"#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111070__section7157142771512\">申请用户穿戴设备权限</a>向用户请求权限。</p>     <p>若用户的运动健康App版本为11.0.3.512及以上，且对第三方应用未进行过授权操作，则消息通知<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__NOTIFY\" target=\"_blank\">NOTIFY</a>、设备基础信息<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__DEVICE_MANAGER\" target=\"_blank\">DEVICE_MANAGER</a>将默认授予第三方应用。建议在请求用户授权前，先使用该接口查询应用是否已有相关权限。</p>     <div class=\"note\">      <img originheight=\"38\" originwidth=\"102\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/70/v3/P79wD8srR5yr6uM7ocVSUw/note_3.0-zh-cn.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261114T022434Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=3FD3C8D1423C39FD49864C00117664AC4C306BCD0A48A36C5FF195B80F752B6B\"><span class=\"notetitle\"> </span>      <div class=\"notebody\">       <p>请确保权限已在<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-Guides/applying-wearengine-0000001050777982\">申请Wear Engine服务</a>中审批通过，否则会遇到错误码为8的提示。</p>      </div>     </div>     <ol>      <li><span>第三方应用调用<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/hiwear-0000001060938716\" target=\"_blank\">HiWear</a>中的<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/hiwear-0000001060938716#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951394__getAuthClient-android_content_Context-\" target=\"_blank\">getAuthClient</a>方法，获取<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/authclient-0000001059980967\" target=\"_blank\">AuthClient</a>对象。</span></li>      <li><span>调用<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/authclient-0000001059980967#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950749__checkPermission-com_huawei_wearengine_auth_Permission-\" target=\"_blank\">checkPermission</a>方法，查询权限是否授予，或调用<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/authclient-0000001059980967#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950749__checkPermissions-com_huawei_wearengine_auth_Permission:A-\" target=\"_blank\">checkPermissions</a>方法，查询一组权限是否授予。</span>       <p></p>       <pre class=\"screen\">// 步骤1：获取AuthClient对象\nAuthClient authClient = HiWear.getAuthClient(this);\n\n// 步骤2：调用checkPermission方法，查询权限是否授予\nauthClient.checkPermission(Permission.DEVICE_MANAGER).addOnSuccessListener(new OnSuccessListener&lt;Boolean&gt;() {\n    @Override\n    public void onSuccess(Boolean aBoolean) {\n        // 返回权限是否授予，true为授予，false为未授予\n    }\n}).addOnFailureListener(new OnFailureListener() {\n    @Override\n    public void onFailure(Exception e) {\n        // 接口调用失败\n    }\n});\n\n// 或调用checkPermissions方法，查询一组权限是否授予\nPermission[] permissions = {Permission.DEVICE_MANAGER,Permission.NOTIFY};\nauthClient.checkPermissions(permissions).addOnSuccessListener(new OnSuccessListener&lt;Boolean[]&gt;() {\n    @Override\n    public void onSuccess(Boolean[] booleans) {\n        // 返回权限是否授予，true为授予，false为未授予，按照权限的查询顺序返回对应的值。\n    }\n}).addOnFailureListener(new OnFailureListener() {\n    @Override\n    public void onFailure(Exception e) {\n        // 接口调用失败\n    }\n});</pre>       <p></p></li>     </ol>    </div>    <div class=\"section\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111070__section7157142771512\">     <a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111070__section7157142771512\"></a><a name=\"section7157142771512\"></a>     <h4>申请用户穿戴设备权限</h4>     <div class=\"fignone\">      <span class=\"figcap\"><b>图1 </b>请求用户授权</span>     </div>     <p><span><img originheight=\"872\" originwidth=\"405\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/c7/v3/cJd2-fmzR5yJA1xBcnYGbg/zh-cn_image_0000002504343619.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261114T022434Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=D7D0E93777C351F126F7580D0343D9BBF4DA335C91A62D1FC9EDDBC64A8D24B7\"></span></p>     <p></p>     <ol>      <li><span>第三方应用调用<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/hiwear-0000001060938716\" target=\"_blank\">HiWear</a>中的<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/hiwear-0000001060938716#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951394__getAuthClient-android_content_Context-\" target=\"_blank\">getAuthClient</a>方法，获取<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/authclient-0000001059980967\" target=\"_blank\">AuthClient</a>对象。</span></li>      <li><span>定义用户授权的回调对象authCallback。</span></li>      <li><span>调用<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/authclient-0000001059980967#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950749__requestPermission-com_huawei_wearengine_auth_AuthCallback-com_huawei_wearengine_auth_Permission___-\" target=\"_blank\">requestPermission</a>方法，向用户请求权限。执行成功后，会弹出授权界面，让用户选择授予权限。当用户允许后才能正常使用接口，否则会遇到错误码为9的提示。</span>       <p></p>       <div class=\"note\">        <img originheight=\"38\" originwidth=\"102\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/6b/v3/d7ZzOemHQ3iynZMDzq7dSA/note_3.0-zh-cn.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261114T022434Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=4B3537650B7017EF0D2028F30895E2C940CD30C1C9BB06AAC58CA8F98204509F\"><span class=\"notetitle\"> </span>        <div class=\"notebody\">         <ul>          <li>请确保向用户请求的权限已在<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-Guides/applying-wearengine-0000001050777982\">申请Wear Engine服务</a>中审批通过，否则会遇到错误码为8的提示。</li>          <li>该功能可以多次调用，如果申请的权限之前已经授予了，不会再弹出授权页面，接口会返回已经授权的权限。</li>          <li>通过入参的<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005\" target=\"_blank\">Permission</a>对象，获取第三方应用需要的权限。参见<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-Guides/applying-wearengine-0000001050777982#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218__table99191256194614\">获取的权限</a>了解应用所需请求的权限类型。</li>          <li>通过<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/authcallback-0000001059850647\" target=\"_blank\">AuthCallback</a>对象，返回用户的授权结果：onOk的回调返回用户授权的权限列表；onCancel表示取消授权。</li>         </ul>        </div>       </div>       <pre class=\"screen\">// 步骤1：获取AuthClient对象\n// this 表示应用上下文Context对象\nAuthClient authClient = HiWear.getAuthClient(this);\n\n// 步骤2：定义用户授权的回调对象\nAuthCallback authCallback = <span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,128);\">new </span>AuthCallback() {\n    @Override\n    <span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,128);\">public void </span>onOk(Permission[] permissions) {\n        // 返回用户授予的权限列表\n    }\n    @Override\n    <span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,128);\">public void </span>onCancel() {\n        // 用户取消授权\n    }\n};\n\n// 步骤3：请求用户授权指定的权限（如：DEVICE_MANAGER，设备管理权限）\nauthClient.requestPermission(authCallback, Permission.<span style=\"color: rgb(102,14,122);\">DEVICE_MANAGER</span>)\n    .addOnSuccessListener(<span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,128);\">new </span>OnSuccessListener&lt;Void&gt;() {\n        @Override\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,128);\">        public void </span>onSuccess(Void successVoid) {\n            // 请求授权任务执行成功\n        }\n    })\n    .addOnFailureListener(<span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,128);\">new </span>OnFailureListener() {\n        @Override\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,128);\">        public void </span>onFailure(Exception e) {\n            // 请求授权任务执行失败\n        }\n    });\n\n// 说明：可一次申请多个权限，多个权限之间用逗号分隔：authClient.requestPermission(authCallback, Permission.DEVICE_MANAGER,Permission.NOTIFY,其他权限)\n// 说明：调用该API后，会弹出授权界面，让用户选择授予权限</pre>       <p></p></li>     </ol>    </div>   </div>   <div></div></body></html>","metadata":{}},"catalogName":"connectivity-Guides","isImport":2,"tag":"10102010","fileName":"requesting-user-authorization-0000001050819181","navigationAddress":"/hmos/hms/smart-device","updatedDate":"2026-10-10 04:06:05","serviceBreadUrl":"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/hms/huawei-wearengine","websiteType":"1","isGray":0,"restrictedType":0,"subTitle":"Smart Device","domainBreadName":"","searchTitle":"","keywords":"","intelligentRecommendFlag":false,"versionLabels":["hmos"],"contentLabels":["celin-hmos","hms-core","notuse"],"showBeta":0,"displayUpdateTime":"2026-10-10 11:04:00","deviceVersion":""}}